msgstr "Τι περιέχει αυτή η θύρα ελεγκτή GameCube."

#: port/frontend/shell/porpoise_rows.cpp:199 port/frontend/shell/porpoise_rows.cpp:211 port/frontend/shell/porpoise_rows.cpp:223 port/frontend/shell/porpoise_rows.cpp:235
